# draftround.part -- Rounds on the faces of an outline with a draft
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The L of draft.part without the hole.  The rounds of its two ends run
# along planes at a slant, as cylinders, and round cones, as tori; at
# the one sharp corner two of them end on each other.  The crease at
# y = 10 stays sharp, and so do the two edges of the sharp corner, which
# turn there.

profile p along y 0 0 2 30 0 3 side s1 30 20 0 side s2 20 20 2 20 8 2 0 8 1
extrude a from 0 to 10 p
extrude b from 10 to 30 p draft 1
union s a b
round 0.4 convex
sharp a.side b.side
sharp a.s1 a.s2
sharp b.s1 b.s2
